# Exp4 Hungarian cluster mapping

Maps K∈{10,15,25,30} to K=20 (Fig. 4) with `scipy.optimize.linear_sum_assignment` (required + optional column copies) and cross-checks with `networkx.min_cost_flow` (required edge capacity 1 per receiving cluster).

